        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Tubarão Terrestre. Gible vive em cavernas e embosca qualquer um que se aproxime, mordendo com tanta força que seus dentes podem lascar. Ele constrói ninhos em buracos horizontais aquecidos por energia geotérmica.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Gible pode evoluir para Gabite no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Sand Attack, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Dragon Rage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Dragon Breath</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Sandstorm, Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bulldoze</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Sand Tomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bite, Dragon Claw, Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dig</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Dragon Rush</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Attract, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Draco Meteor, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Claw, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fire Blast, Fire Fang, Flamethrower, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Metal Claw, Mud Shot, Outrage, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scale Shot, Scary Face, Scorching Sands, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Stealth Rock, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder Fang, Toxic</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Body Slam, Double-Edge, Dragon Breath, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Metal Claw, Mud Shot, Outrage, Rock Climb, Sand Tomb, Scary Face, Thrash, Twister</p>",
